{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01299",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 2.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.9,
      "end_seconds": 8.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.8,
      "end_seconds": 13.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I'm here because of sensitivity to light."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.94,
      "end_seconds": 15.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.3,
      "end_seconds": 23.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Ever since... since last weekend, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.18,
      "end_seconds": 27.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.45,
      "end_seconds": 47.47,
      "duration_seconds": 18.02,
      "text": "I'd give it a seven, out of ten. I've had a pounding headache too, for about four days. About pounding headache, I'd say severe. It's worse with bright lights and loud noise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.95,
      "end_seconds": 59.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any fever, double vision, loss of consciousness or slurred speech?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.59,
      "end_seconds": 63.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.59,
      "end_seconds": 66.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.1,
      "end_seconds": 69.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.34,
      "end_seconds": 75.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.94,
      "end_seconds": 79.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.01,
      "end_seconds": 82.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.48,
      "end_seconds": 86.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Um, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.49,
      "end_seconds": 91.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "So, do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.77,
      "end_seconds": 94.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "I've got migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.73,
      "end_seconds": 98.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.97,
      "end_seconds": 110.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.13,
      "end_seconds": 115.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I'm on propranolol, 40 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.79,
      "end_seconds": 131.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.6,
      "end_seconds": 137.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.58,
      "end_seconds": 156.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.89,
      "end_seconds": 161.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.37,
      "end_seconds": 164.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.37,
      "end_seconds": 168.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.49,
      "end_seconds": 171.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.47,
      "end_seconds": 187.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.34,
      "end_seconds": 206.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 108 over 74, temperature is 36.9 degrees, pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.75,
      "end_seconds": 210.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.69,
      "end_seconds": 213.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.35,
      "end_seconds": 218.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.23,
      "end_seconds": 233.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.48,
      "end_seconds": 235.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.42,
      "end_seconds": 257.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Cranial nerves look normal, eye movements are full."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.75,
      "end_seconds": 261.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.81,
      "end_seconds": 272.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So where does that leave us? This looks most like a migraine pattern."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.64,
      "end_seconds": 276.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.32,
      "end_seconds": 289.98,
      "duration_seconds": 12.66,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a migraine pattern is my leading thought, not anything worse. An MRI of the brain is what I'd like next, for recurrent headaches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 290.54,
      "end_seconds": 294.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "We have a slot Tuesday at 2 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.52,
      "end_seconds": 315.76,
      "duration_seconds": 20.24,
      "text": "I'm prescribing domperidone, 10 milligrams, when nauseous, as needed. It's for migraine nausea. Try not to skip meals and keep your sleep regular. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. See me again in six weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.73,
      "end_seconds": 320.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.05,
      "end_seconds": 327.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}